WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.951
Your demo account is selected in the terminal.

2
00:00:05.001 --> 00:00:09.095
Open the market list and search for a market.

3
00:00:09.145 --> 00:00:13.145
Select the pair you want to trade.

4
00:00:13.437 --> 00:00:16.187
Set the size: here, 500 dollars of collateral.

5
00:00:16.237 --> 00:00:20.474
Choose the leverage within your plan limit.

6
00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:26.047
Review the order: the estimate comes from the server.

7
00:00:26.097 --> 00:00:28.816
Confirm to open the position on your demo account.

8
00:00:28.866 --> 00:00:34.866
Your position appears under Positions.
